      "role": "user",
      "content": "routine or hobbies wont change the fact that i'm basically a ghost. i've spent years building this life where nobody can touch me and no one can hurt me, but now i'm just stuck in a cage of my own making. it's like i'm waiting for something to happen but i know nothing will, and i'm just... done with the waiting.",
